00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:13.320
Men who looked like me.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:16.260
Men who at first were just
curious and adventurous

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:20.790
but soon whose motives morphed
into an insatiable greed.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:24.693
A confidence that their way
was better than everyone elses.

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:30.690
This confidence led to arguably
the most influential series

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:32.553
