00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:02.670
Instead, this is the first of three videos

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:05.010
where I want to show
you how this happened.

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:09.450
How Europe, a continent full
of poor, miserable farmers

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:13.200
took over the entire
world, and in the process,

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:15.480
they shaped it, they
shaped it to their way

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:18.900
of thinking and speaking and doing things.

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:22.384
So this is part one of how
Europe stole the world.

